
# Search for product <searchKeyword> and verify results

// Navigate the searchbar and enter the search key word
* Find Element Where "selectorTypeId" is "searchBoxId" then click
* Move to "defaultMouseX" , "defaultMouseY" then click
* Find Element Where "selectorTypeId" is "searchBoxId" then click
* Find Failed Where "selectorTypeCss" is "searchInputCss" then fill with "searchKeyword"
* Press "enterKey"

// Veryfy Result Page
* Verify Element where "selectorTypeCss" is "productListCss"
* Assertion|Verify The Search Response

// Make sure that we have the 5. product
// first product in the second raw
* Verify Element where "selectorTypeCss" is "secondRowProductCss"
